<title>INDIA: India's Sterlite down ahead of results.</title>
<headline>India's Sterlite down ahead of results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Indian cable maker Sterlite Industries fell 20.50 rupees or 9.5 percent to 194 on the Bombay bourse in afternoon trade, brokers said.  </p>
<p>Sterlite shares slipped 14.65 rupees to 198.50 on the National Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Traders said punters were driving the stock lower ahead of its results for the year ended June 30, 1996 -- expected later today.</p>
<p>Analysts say they expect net profit to be 16-18 percent higher than last year's 1,149 million.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
